{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34259","headline":"奉和袭美茶具十咏 茶瓯 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美茶具十咏 茶瓯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔人谢塸埞，徒爲妍词饰。\n岂如珪璧姿，又有烟岚色。\n光参筠席上，韵雅金罍侧。\n直使于阗君，从来未尝识。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34259.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34259","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}